    "text": "Feb. 27, 2025: 5:20 p.m.:\nJ.D. Vance points out that by extension, U.K. infringement of free speech impacts Americans\nSome of the U.K.’s free speech infringements include technology and tracking social media posts.\nJD Vance just called out UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer to his face for infringing on free speech, says he will talk to him about it at lunch.\n“I said what I said…”\n“There have been infringements on free speech….”\n[pic.twitter.com/Nrz8hA1RsW]— Derrick Evans (@DerrickEvans4WV)\n[February 27, 2025]",
